```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

April 19, 2021
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-15-21 for a Contract between the City of Cheyenne and
Craig Construction Services LLC, for the Michael Drive Sidewalk Project
______________________________________________
Five (5) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached. Project Site Location Map
is also attached.

The Five (5) bids were received from:

1. Craig Construction Services LLC.  Laramie, Wyoming.
2. S & S Builders, LLC.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
3. Rocky Mountain Sand & Gravel.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
4. Reiman Corp.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
5. Knife River.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The bids were reviewed by Tom Cobb (Engineering), and Sam Berta (Engineering).

Their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid from Craig Construction Services
LLC.  The bid award is for $43,311.25

Funding:
020-26-2616-42-43492 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Miscellaneous Concrete)
$43,311.25
```

